WEBVTT

00:00:00.052 --> 00:00:02.792
Expand customers in the Tables panel.

00:00:02.792 --> 00:00:04.133
Select Add field to create a new column.

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:05.748
Name the field display_name.

00:00:05.748 --> 00:00:07.618
Open the type picker and search for varchar.

00:00:07.618 --> 00:00:09.873
Select varchar. The canvas updates immediately. Save your personal diagram when finished.
